Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:15:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] Stats check: refuse Black Ops II stat files a real game
 can't write

mpstatsCompressed (raw deflate, 48-byte header, then the ddl_mp/stats.ddl v244 buffer read from game memory) is
compared with the player's previous file: prestige, rank and XP past the maximum, a prestige jump of more than
one, or more XP than one match can give are refused and logged as 'anticheat: <name> sent impossible stats'.

